   }
  },
  {
   "turn": 2,
   "response_text": "This is very concerning! The validation accuracy values are significantly **above** the healthy range. The healthy range is 0.8519\u20130.8607, but all values in this run are around 0.89\u20130.90, which is dramatically higher. This suggests the model is performing suspiciously well.\n\nLet me check the training logs to see if there are any issues:",
   "tool_calls": [
    {
     "id": "toolu_01Gh9GznUropZYceS2V8dXxP",
     "name": "read_log",
