    "input_tokens": 3655,
    "output_tokens": 141
   }
  },
  {
   "turn": 3,
   "response_text": "The logs don't show errors, but the validation accuracy is consistently around 0.90, which is far above the healthy range of 0.8519\u20130.8607. Let me check the training code to understand what might be causing this anomaly:",
   "tool_calls": [
